  str_pet_equip_name_1602371 = "Dreamy Aria",
  str_pet_equip_name_1602381 = "Eternal Oath's Insignia",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1200501 = "These two modified bats are similar in length to ordinary bats, but their circular saw blade greatly enhances their lethality, whether they're used for hacking or swinging.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300221 = "Chainsaw Rick is known for starting up his electric saw and charging into the enemy, swinging indiscriminately at whoever or whatever stands in his way. As his saw's temperature rises, so does its power, and Chainsaw Rick needs to continually fill it up with diesel, while also guzzling it down himself. When his saw starts to overheat, Chainsaw Rick's combat power goes through the roof.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300461 = "This is a set of four items owned by the four members of Keating's squad. At first, they didn't pay much attention to them, but soon found out that there was a link between the four items of the Scroll of Chanting, which could not only enhance the power of sound-type Luminatics, but also produce more powerful effects when coordinated properly.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300471 = "When Zoya traveled to the Nether Sea, the Quarkium there had a mysterious effect on her, and she fell into a deep slumber. After leaving the Nether Sea, Zoya obtained part of a Quarkium crystal, and learned to utilize its power. She inlaid it on her ice staff, greatly improving her strength in combat.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300491 = "A pair of pitch black swords Istvan bought for Seleucid after he joined Istvan Gang. These two lightweight swords are said to be ancient relics, and are perpetually covered with frost. After receiving them, Seleucid soon mastered the art of dual blade swordsmanship.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300511 = "A high-temperature grenade launcher and a light mini sniper rifle—this combo of weapons is used exclusively by Sork and Bekk. Sork uses the grenade launcher, while Bekk uses the sniper rifle, and the two of them work in perfect unison to easily defeat hordes of enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300521 = "A feather left to Dove by her parents. It can greatly improve Dove's movement speed, and can also enhance the power of her Luminatics, allowing her to throw blades more accurately and more rapidly.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300531 = "Jomu's blade, stored in a cargo container. Lightweight and easy to both wield and carry. After years of experience, Jomu knows exactly how to use it to maximize his strength and wreak havoc on the battlefield.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300581 = "After becoming a knight, Amy soon became a banner bearer and received this spear. She can inject her own Luminatics into the Aurora Spear, transforming it into a banner capable of inspiring her teammates and enhancing their morale and teamwork.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300591 = "When Pepi used her own flame for the first time, she accidentally burned herself. Of all the feathers lost that day, only this one survived, retaining within it a flickering trace of flame. Since then, Pepi has held onto this feather, drawing power from it to boost her agility.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300741 = "When White Dwarf's abilities erupt, two spheres appear around him. These spheres can charge to attack distant enemies, and can also fuse together to generate a huge explosion capable of annihilating all nearby enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300801 = "Unimet's crazed passion for machinery compels her to constantly create robotic arms, and they say she has produced no less than 23 in total... She keeps these robotic arms in her huge backpack, which is always bulging with weaponry. She can control these arms to fight and work on her behalf whenever she needs them.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300821 = "Ophina was born carrying a turquoise stone. As she grew up, this turquoise became brighter and brighter, and as it did, the power of the Lumina within it grew in intensity, forming a mysterious link with the huge emerald horns on her head. Ophina inlaid this turquoise on her staff, and now uses it to guide the Luminatics within her.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300871 = "N/A",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400071 = "This peculiarly-shaped dart is known as the Sickle Blade. After Clover joined the Rediesel Wrenches, it was specially modified to perfectly suit her petite frame. Clover dedicated countless hours to mastering the skills of using this new Sickle Blade, and now that she is proficient with it, she can shoot it faster and farther.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400081 = "After joining the Rediesel Wrenches, Tiny One wasn't allowed to fight, due to her age and various other reasons—but that was until she found this spotlight in the Rediesel Desert. She studied it carefully with every free moment she had and modified it to emit a remarkably strong beam of light that can be used to attack Eclipsites.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400161 = "Kafka stumbled upon this weapon while hunting down Eclipsites in the mysterious ruins of the Rediesel Desert. Believed to have originated from an ancient civilization, this sniper rifle features modified electromagnetic tracking for enhanced accuracy, and launches powerful penetrating bullets.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400171 = "Odi modified this huge electric drill to give it a sleek black finish with an interweaving red sheen. Though it is somewhat bulky, it is very light, and Rabbie can easily wield it in the heat of battle. Now that she has completely mastered its use, this electric drill has become her exclusive weapon.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400321 = "Angel was born with a pair of beautiful wings, however, one of them was permanently damaged in an Eclipsite attack, leaving only a cluster of feathers. Angel carries these feathers with her, hoping to one day restore her damaged wing.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400351 = "This was the first feather that grew out of Eho after she was born, and it was hidden among many other feathers when she grew up. However, after Eho had been through many adventures, this feather's pattern underwent a fascinating transformation which resulted in an unusual mark appearing on it. This became Eho's unique weapon.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400401 = "Joanie Boom has always been fascinated with explosions, and after joining the Rediesel Wrenches, this passion became even more intense. Every time she fights, she uses all kinds of her own carefully-crafted bombs to blast away the Eclipsites with fierce explosions and fearsome flames. In her opinion, there is nothing more wonderful in the world than a good bomb.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400411 = "Ms. Blanc always has a white suitcase accompanying her. It's said that it contains mysterious weapons, while others say that it contains the various eye-accounts that Ms. Blanc had recorded. However, no one has ever seen this suitcase open...",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400441 = "Using Illumina Tech and rare metals, Gannon City's researchers crafted their latest weapon specially for Vivian—a sharp blade that is as light as it is thin. It can also direct the Lumina in Vivian's body, exerting even greater power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400451 = "The special blood coursing through Nails' body grants him great strength, but also brings endless pain. In order to suppress the power of his blood, Nails stabbed himself with a holy hammer, but over the course of time, this blood-soaked hammer also gained mysterious power, allowing Nails to unleash its might in battle to destroy his enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400481 = "An extremely sharp pair of serpentine daggers. Dayna has been using them ever since she began traveling with Robyn, and after years of combat, Dayna is now proficient in using them. They can not only cut through her enemies quickly, but also unleash the Lumina within Dayna's body to eliminate her opponents faster.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400541 = "This lantern with a long chain is the symbol of the Nightwatch and never goes out. Even in the darkest places, Nadine, as Captain of the Nightwatch, can hold this lantern high and use her own Luminatics to emit a shining light, dispersing the darkness and repelling her enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400571 = "Though it looks like a walking stick, it is in fact made of the latest Illumina Tech. It can transform into a dagger, and can also be used to heal, alleviating the unstable emotions in Philyshy's heart.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400611 = "After discovering Chandra's true strength, Gronru made a ring for her. This ring enables Chandra to transform the negative emotions she absorbs and releases a magnificent jet of flame, making it truly one of the most advanced products of Illumina Tech.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400681 = "While out on a delivery, Wendy encountered a rare hurricane in the desert. Just when she thought it was all over for her, a feather landed upon her face. In an instant, Wendy was filled with inexplicable courage and flew out of the hurricane. From that day on, she has kept this feather with her at all times, not only as a reminder of her strength, but also as a source of courage.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400731 = "This trident is owned by both of the duo, but is usually used by Patsy, as she is naturally gifted at controlling it. When wielded by Patty, she only uses it to jab at her enemies. But although it can take out her opponents quickly, it can also harm her companions and must be used with caution.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400791 = "An heirloom of Michenny's family that can be traced back to the founding of Lumopolis. As an item powered by the user's faith, the Scale of Judgment has the ability to judge its enemies, turning words into mental attacks.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400811 = "Rediesel Wrench tech personnel specially modified Brock's boxing gear, reinforcing it for extreme hardness. This gear also utilizes Brock's turbines to enhance the impact of their suction and jet injection, allowing Brock to knock out his opponents with ease.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400831 = "A white broom with a unique mechanical style, specially developed by the Illumina Federation's scientific research lab. It features a complex mechanical transmission device that works in conjunction with Lilliam's special Luminatics, allowing Lilliam to sweep away all kinds of garbage, as well as clean up all manner of pests in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400851 = "Jane's suitcase is full of all kinds of files and materials, such as the secrets of Umbraton, the struggles between the most notorious gangs, secret agreements drafted by the nation's higher-ups, and more. According to Jane herself, this is the true source of her strength.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400861 = "This ceremonial sword is purported to have been made according to designs drawn by Uriah herself, and is known as the Flower of Prayer. Although it possesses extremely high resilience, the blade is too thin, and it can't compete with most other weapons. The truth is, only Uriah can exert its full power using her own secret technique.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400911 = "This is the harp of Chloe's father. Playing skillfully, she can weave her own Luminatics into the notes, using her Luminatics to both influence others and sooth the injured souls of her companions.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500091 = "A box bestowed by Victoria after joining True Order. It contains some kind of being that can devour anything. Its objective is not clear, and all that is known is that it is particularly fond of painful memories. However, after Faust obtained this box, his nightmares no longer haunt him.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500121 = "A weapon made by the Illumina Federation's research department specially for Nemesis, features superior electric current manipulation capabilities. By controlling current to stun or injure enemies, it affords Nemesis optimal versatility in various situations.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500131 = "This was the first ice crystal Noah made using her own Luminatics. It has a very special shape, and even after she learned to skillfully make more advanced ice crystals, she decided to keep this unique keepsake. During a certain adventure, she found that this ice crystal had changed, wielding the power of \"Hope\" to greatly enhance Noah's combat effectiveness.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500181 = "This electric guitar was discovered deep in the desert by members of the Rediesel Wrench. At first, it was just discarded in the corner of a truck, but after Regina joined the Rediesel Wrenches, she soon found that this electric guitar was perfectly in tune with her own music style, and it enabled her to unleash her inner strength.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500201 = "This lance was given to Carleen by her father, Duke Sorla, on the day she became a knight. After countless battles in her capable hands, Carleen's special mark appeared upon it. When infusing it with certain sublime materials, Carleen's lance will be extremely powerful.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500211 = "A pair of scissors specially made by the Illumina Federation for Jola. Adjustable in size, Jola first used them as a gardening tool to help with cultivating plants, but she soon developed new features for them so that they could play a vital role in battles.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500311 = "This lance was given to Carleen by her father, Duke Sorla, on the day she became a knight. After countless battles in her capable hands, Carleen's special mark appeared upon it. When infusing it with certain sublime materials, Carleen's lance will be extremely powerful.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500331 = "A longbow specially made for Vice by Gannon City's scientific research lab. Similar to a dragon's armor, it is reinforced with special materials which not only enhance the accuracy of Vice's Luminatics, but also greatly improve their power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500341 = "This lance was given to Carleen by her father, Duke Sorla, on the day she became a knight. After countless battles in her capable hands, Carleen's special mark appeared upon it. When infusing it with certain sublime materials, Carleen's lance will be extremely powerful.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500361 = "Hydrad found this object in some ancient ruins and soon discovered that it possesses a mysterious, ancient power. It looks like a glass bottle emitting a wonderful blue light, and can unleash special magic to summon magical creatures known as \"Shadow Wolf\" to help Hydrad in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500421 = "As a primary weapon, the Barton Knife is a modified version of the epee made with rare materials, and has the ability to guide Lumina to deal fatal damage. The upgraded \"Sherman Modified\" submachine gun is a modified version of the basic Sherman submachine gun featuring double the ammo capacity, a heavier barrel, and greatly enhanced sustained firepower.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500701 = "A golden ring engraved with mysterious words. It can guide the mighty power within Leona's blood and can utilize the pure power of flame, known as \"Dragon Breath\", to destroy everything in sight.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500751 = "Using the knowledge she gained in the Illumina Federation and her genius inspiration, Odi picked out a selection of useful materials from the Rediesel Wrench's hoard of booty, and gradually perfected a kind of large optical cable—a strange weapon running on self-propelling energy that moves like a sandworm.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500761 = "It looks like it once belonged to some kind of deep-sea monster, and though Kleken claims that he created this tentacle using his own special Luminatics. Its true source is unknown.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500781 = "Though it may be an ordinary iron pipe, it can still be deadly in the right hands. Robyn can use her own Luminatics to form a sharp wind blade on this pipe, which can easily cut through the enemy's armor with terrifying power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500841 = "A pure golden staff of Viper Twins, with a special design that allows flames to circulate within it. Istvan can use it to summon a blue phantom flame that burns everything in his vicinity. The energy released by these flames can not only take down his opponents, but also strengthen the combat ability of his entire team.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500881 = "This leather bomb bag is always filled with various mass-produced bombs. Ordinarily, these bombs are not particularly powerful, but if Maggie injects a great deal of Lumina into them, they can achieve cataclysmic explosive power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500901 = "A modified circular electric saw with a unique cordon-like strap. Rumored to originally have been a microphone, it was allegedly converted into a weapon at Barbara's request to deal with her crazy fans... However, Barbara vehemently denies this.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500921 = "Pact doesn't carry this wheel-like object, covered with withered thorns, by choice. It is like a restless ghost—no matter where it is thrown, no matter how far she runs, it returns to her eventually. Though mysterious and terrifying, it also affords her great power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600011 = "This huge mirror is a relic of Northland, which can produce mysterious illusions. Known as the \"Northland Mirror\", it is indispensable to Nikinis. Not only can she use Luminatics to make the mirror float, she can also channel Lumina through the mirror and her flowers to destroy her opponents in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600021 = "Like Hiiro, this blade is from the Far East. It is rumored that Hiiro's master, Sakae Shigeo, endowed this blade with great power and with his life force, attuning it to Hiiro's very essence. Therefore, this weapon is named \"Katana: Sakae.\" It is very powerful, but prolonged use will consume the power in Hiiro's body.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600031 = "This lance was given to Carleen by her father, Duke Sorla, on the day she became a knight. After countless battles in her capable hands, Carleen's special mark appeared upon it. When infusing it with certain sublime materials, Carleen's lance will be extremely powerful.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600041 = "Although Kuma's white barbed bat and Pengy's orange rockets look scary, Kuma and Pengy don't rely on them as their main method of attack. Instead, they use their powerful Luminatics and solid cooperation to best their enemies in combat.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600051 = "After Mia moved to nearby Umbraton, her \"Baba Yaga\" personality often made trouble around town, to the extent that rumors of the mischievous \"Black Spider\" began to circulate. After hearing this, Baba Yaga specially made this ornament with her own Luminatics to enhance her and Mia's power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600061 = "This lance was given to Carleen by her father, City Lord Schwartz himself, on the day she became a knight. After countless battles in her capable hands, Carleen's special mark appeared upon it, signifying her complete mastery of this weapon, while also greatly enhancing the power of her lance.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600101 = "Louise's \"Pocket Magic\" can create all kinds of things, but they all eventually disappear. Only this fairy tale book remains today. Believing it contains magical power, she took it with her, and sure enough, it actually began to enhance her inner power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600111 = "This katana is an heirloom of Sharona's family, the Kartimas. It is said that it was handed down from the Far East thousands of years ago. Its blade constantly exudes a blue aura similar to a flame, and it works in perfect synchronization with Sharona's Dragon Power to generate a fearsome destructive force.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600141 = "An heirloom of the Schwartz family, this huge sword, known as the Sovereign's Blade, looks more like a symbol of power than an actual weapon. When Schwartz uses it, it summons an array of light blades that surround Schwartz like glowing stars and follow his orders.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600191 = "Victoria's Black Tome. Said to originally have been a magic book, its pages are blank most of the time, and are unable to be written upon. Legend has it that when the Illumination comes, bright red ink will fill the pages of the book, leaving behind a prophecy once it fades.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600231 = "This clarinet was left to Connolly by her parents. She spent her lonely childhood practicing on this clarinet, eventually awakening the power hidden within her. From the clarinet emerged tentacled monsters known as Antons. Antons follow Connolly's every command, attacking or entangling her enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600251 = "Although the pistol that appeared with Charon's train, Other End, is seemingly an ordinary flintlock gun, after Charon unleashed his ability, this pistol formed a mysterious link with him, and its power improved tremendously.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600261 = "The golden ring of fire that surrounds Uriel is full of special slots that can spray, store, and absorb flames. Specially made for Uriel, this item can only bear her unique flame power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600271 = "A floating ringed sword with a fine blade, specially made for Michael in Lumopolis. It bears a magic rune engraved by Michael, and can guide the thunder power in Michael's body to launch lightning-fast thrusts.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600281 = "A large mechanical box with a cross-shaped structure containing numerous Holy Water Shells. Raphael can control the holy water within to deal damage to enemies and heal allies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600291 = "A light yellow crystal ball with a simple pattern. This crystal ball enhances Gabriel's Luminatics, and allows her to summon and use the Bird Cage anytime and anywhere.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600381 = "This ancient machine known as the \"Throne\" is in fact Gronru's private vehicle—a fortress-like structure possessing immense destructive power. It is controlled by the Throne Mecha Gloves, and Gronru can make it move in sync with her own actions.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600601 = "These three modified guns with peculiar shapes are very distinct from revolvers. With her mechanical hands and 6-shot mag, Jona can shower a hail of bullets on her enemies, laying down powerful suppressive fire.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600641 = "Wrath, an adept commander, commissioned the Illumina Federation's scientific research lab to specially customize this floating machine array made of extremely hard alloys, which is now called the \"Patrol Array.\" She subsequently increased her control over the Patrol Array using her \"Ace\" boxing gloves, allowing her to command it with ease.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600771 = "This long sword is known as the \"Starorbit Blade.\" Its hilt is surrounded by a cross-shaped orbit, symbolizing the power of the Queen of the North. Though it was made using the pure power of the Aurora, Bethlehem does not usually use it in combat, and some even believe that it is more a symbol of her identity.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600891 = "This is the collective name for the \"Staff of Judgment\" and \"Sword of Borrowing\" wielded by Irridon. The Staff of Judgment represents Irridon's lineage, while the Sword of Borrowing represents her heart's true desire.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500871 = "After inheriting her rightful position, Beverly made this spear-like brooch, infused with Lumina capable of generating great lightning and allowing Beverly to create more lightning spears with increased speed and deadliness.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500241 = "Firelash is the firearm Benny uses to provide cover fire, and supposedly can be tweaked for different purposes. Lightspeed is Curo's incredibly sharp bayonet. The combination has made Benny and Curo unbeatable.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1401011 = "After Ansia joined the military, she let her sonic power quickly be known, so the tech labs in Gannon made this diffuser specially for her. Story has it that Ansia uses it to shape the soundwaves in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600931 = "This command saber is not only used for command and training troops, it is imbued with Migard's own unique Lumina. Thus, it emitted an eerie glow that melts all adversaries who come into contact.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1401021 = "To control her sporadic bursts of plasma, Tessa purchased this pair of insulated gloves, specially tailored by the guild in Umbraton; her personal mark is even embossed on them. With this pair of insulated gloves, Tessa is able to manage her plasma energy with much more ease.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500991 = "This is the magic sword of Areia's family with a powerful curse. It has an ominous black shine. It can gather Lumina for a mighty cleave, and lets Areia control black thorns to both attack foes and defend allies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600961 = "A special water wheel created by Sariel at peak power. It appears to be a burst of water, but in actuality extremely solid. Sariel believes its wondrous shape and color represent her different abilities: \"Bi-color Wheel\" and \"Turbid Wheel.\" It does enhance both abilities.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500971 = "Corax's surgeon experience made him second to none with scalpels. To him, anywhere on an enemy is a weak spot and target for dissection. These scalpels are not only honed to utter sharpness by his Lumina powers, but they can be manipulated to attack at range.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500981 = "This black flower has been with Cuscuta since she was born. Yet when her power manifested for the first time, it withered. Cuscuta eventually discovered it is connected to her power and began to wear it all the time.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400621 = "When Sylva first picked up fencing, his father gave him a vine and taught him to turn it into a rapier with his own power. Sylva has kept the vine ever since to commemorate his father.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300941 = "Legacy from Leah's parents. It enables Leah to attack with the forces of nature and coalesce the steam in the forest to envelope herself and her teammates, boosting their defenses.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601031 = "After discovering Eicy's formidable, catastrophic power in her right pupil, the True Order created this staff for her and engraved it with Eicy's personal mark, enabling her to control her power through the magic focus.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501001 = "This is the key to open the Starry Crypt. With it, Sikare can conjure countless traps and monsters beneath where her foes stand, as well as the true Starry Crypt under her own feet to grant her even greater power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400951 = "Lester was born with a bad body odor. That didn't erode her self-esteem but spurred her to make a special costume and collect her scent in gas cannisters that she throws to harm enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500561 = "Constantine picked up this gun in ruin during his journey. Its original owner fought Eclipsites to the death. Constantine admired the determination and made the firearm his weapon.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1400671 = "Originally carved from a normal crystal, this collar stud became a precious ruby with marvelous warmth when Alice manifested her powers for the first time.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1600301 = "It is said that this oversized wrench was used by the first chief of Rediesel Wrench, and that only those who can wield it with ease are qualified to become the chief. The hard hammerhead combined with Sinsa's power makes it capable of smashing anything.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601051 = "After Eve's recovery, the tech personnel of Rediesel Wrench specially made these mechanical gloves for her. This pair of gloves helps Eve recover faster and enhances her ability to guide the Lumina flowing through her body.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501041 = "After Dawn became blind, she installed the chime she always carried with her since she was a child onto her staff. The sweet sound of the chime calms Dawn's heart.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500711 = "This serrated blade may look plain, but it is highly compatible with Taki and can guide the power of flames in Taki's body.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1701101 = "A huge lance that has a complicated mechanical structure. A war-ravaged blue and white banner with a Star Crest on it flies in the air above it. This lance is a device that augments thunder magic, and it can be used as a melee weapon when enemies get close.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1701091 = "This huge, heavy staff houses special magical powers. Mythos is able to swing this staff with ease and use it to cast powerful spells.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1701081 = "After Frostfire truly mastered the magic crystal called Heart of Magma, she imbued this long whip with special magical powers, giving her the ability to use this long whip to cast all sorts of fire spells in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1701071 = "A huge broken sword that looks like a dark coffin. It has a Star Crest and is pointy and sharp. It is made out of a mysterious special alloy that is indestructible. At the same time, it has a built-in device that amplifies water magic and negates enemy attacks, as well as redirects kinetic energy to provide great protection for the person wielding it.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501131 = "When the True Order discovered Bonacie's abilities, Victoria custom-ordered this silk ribbon baton so that Bonacie could control her \"Divine Intervention\" power and call forth her ensemble of Holy Avatars to summon meteorites.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601111 = "Like a flower, this sanguine crystal grew from her body. Beryl thought that this was the source of her mysterious power, so she kept it on her at all times for strength.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501141 = "A short whip originally used for riding horses. After Genevieve's ability awakened, she combined it with her flaming power to create this Whiplash. The whip incinerates enemies, while the metal clasp can be used to capture her targets.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601121 = "This brooch made from the skull bone of a manticore is Smokey's family heirloom and allows the wearer to control a summoned manticore, as well as improving their mastery over Luminatics.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601161 = "A small, portable toolbox containing all kinds of tools. These tools have been with Fleur for many years, and he considers each one as an extension of his own body.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1401271 = "This special piece of red paper contains mysterious power and is telepathically linked to Pasolo. According to Pasolo, it allows her to see her dead parents and brings her great strength.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601171 = "A powerful set of weapons that combines a broadsword, a revolver, and a fist blade. The broadsword delivers heavy slashes that can fell even the mightiest of foes; the revolver and fist blade are integrated into one to provide flexibility in battle by granting the user both a secondary melee weapon and a powerful projectile launcher.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601191 = "A simple, rugged greatsword that has been reinforced with steel wires. Not only can this weapon channel Revy's inner Lumina, but the steel wires also allow her to throw her blade out to eliminate foes at a distance.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601221 = "A name given to Allura's pocket watch and pistol. The pocket watch greatly amplifies Allura's senses, increasing her accuracy and firepower when using her antique pistol. With these two in her possession, she soon gained widespread recognition as Umbraton's lady gunslinger.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601211 = "Originally a holy emblem from the Temple of Lumopolis, the engraving changed after Paloma witnessed the death of her parents. It symbolizes her disillusionment with her faith and her decision to follow her heart and her own path.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601151 = "Naroxel shares an extraordinary spiritual resonance with the Fireflies, allowing her to command these tiny, glowing insects to attack her foes. This gold-lined satchel made of transparent gauze is where she keeps her little allies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1300651 = "After becoming a courier, Tweety carefully sewed a feather of her own inside the cylindrical cap, which soon became her trademark. Wearing it gives Tweety an enormous boost to her liveliness.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601261 = "Bethel can make this weapon switch between its bell form and long staff form and use it to send out a crisp sound that summons her magic specters, Frankel.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601291 = "After becoming a mercenary, Luke's first gift to himself was this cloak. He painted the pattern himself to celebrate the memory of a butterfly friend he holds deep in his heart. This cloak can strengthen Luke's connection with insects and enables him to use his chains more artfully in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500551 = "An heirloom left to Pittman by his father. The blue gem embedded at its top has the power to summon lightning. Pittman can unleash his staff's summoning ability to launch devastating lightning strikes upon his enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601201 = "Hedy seldom carries this weapon with her and uses it only in combat. Even so, her familiarity with this sword allows her to coordinate perfectly with her Knight of Light in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601231 = "A baton distributed exclusively to Illumina Sheriffs. Once she finally mastered the use of this weapon, Cordy commissioned a team of scientists to make enhancements to it, allowing it to shoot flames with an electrifying stun effect that allows her to neutralize her targets with ease.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1500151 = "Short for \"bada bing bada boom,\" the collective name given by Hachi and Gin to the assortment of weapons they carry around with them. Includes a grenade launcher, a special assault rifle, and hand grenades. Rumor has it that they earned millions in assets using these weapons to settle down and ultimately make a life for themselves.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601311 = "This long staff is said to be made from the sapphire of the first mountain spirit, which can enhance the inner strength of the wielder and unlock their hidden potential.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501321 = "Originally an ordinary vine from Windward Forest, the vine transformed into a bow from the Lumina flowing from Lola's body after she wandered into the forest and slept on it. When Lola finally mastered her Luminatics, it naturally became her weapon of choice.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601331 = "Maid costume transformed from Tohru's scales. Tohru opted to be Kobayashi's maid out of love. To her, this is not merely a work uniform.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601341 = "Accessories adorning the ends of Kanna's pigtails. Actually artifacts that can control dragons by releasing the magic inside.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501361 = "Custom cap worn by Lucoa, with holes made for her protruding horns. She wears it all the time because it's rather difficult to take off.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501351 = "A trident embodying the strength of the sea. In Elma's hands, it can unleash potent water power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1401371 = "Vintage glasses made according to the wearer's style. Made based on a reference photo provided by Tohru.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601381 = "Siobhan chanced upon this tablet made from a special material while exploring the ruins. Apparently, it was originally used as a portable recording tool. Later on, she discovered that she could use Luminatics to enhance the tablet's durability, and with this finding, she began to use it for defense.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501391 = "A slim sword specially designed to be lighter than normal. It can better guide the Lumina in Erica's body, allowing her to emit powerful lightning in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601401 = "This sword has a curved blade that's rarely seen in Lumopolis or even on the continent. Specially made for Florine, it is durable and exceptionally sharp, and it allows her to perform more powerful Luminatics.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601411 = "The baseball bat found in Rediesel Wrench's pile of parts is suspected to be made of some special material. It wasn't long before Ruby discovered that it was a perfect fit for her, and it even strengthens her Luminatics!",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501421 = "Rouge made this weapon herself. It has a special magazine that can be filled with various kinds of ammunition, and Rouge can use her Lumina to detonate bullets after they have been fired. The plier is also able to shoot out copper wire to grapple the enemy.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601431 = "There's more to this emblem on the fan than it seems. To Rinne, it holds a profound meaning. Not only does it allow her to see the aura of ghosts, it also strengthens her control over them.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501441 = "After that mysterious ritual, Kayano could always see the ghost attached to this band. Unable to drive it away, she eventually accepted it and took advantage of the benefits it brought, allowing it to boost her power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601461 = "An arm guard designed and developed by the Lin Guild exclusively for Yao. Made from finely woven silk that is rendered soft yet firm after undergoing special treatment, it allows her to throw punches without risking injuries. More importantly, it matches her attire perfectly.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601451 = "Amemori has carried a collection of secret objects ever since her very first day practicing ninjutsu. In fact, they include not just weapons and ninjutsu tools, but also other objects that most people have never heard of. Together, they ensure that Amemori can complete any mission.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501471 = "A selection of kitchenware that Anzu and Momo will not go anywhere without. These tools are everything they need to prepare a quick but delicious meal. They also use them to beat up bad guys who disturb their cooking.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1201631 = "This board indicates that work has begun. To Tourdog, the crisp clap that it gives off is the most beautiful music in the world. Whenever you see hear its sound, Tourdog is one step closer to realizing its dream...",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601481 = "The rifle is said to have been discovered in a mysterious ruin and came into Azure's possession when she was little. It gains a beautiful deep blue hue under direct sunlight and can fire many kinds of bullets.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501491 = "A small pouch that Roy carries with him at all times. Contains various tools, explosives, parts for the Sweeties (his mechanical bees), and candies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601501 = "It's supposedly just a small sturdy wooden stick, but in Lenore's hands, combined with a drop of her blood and her special Luminatics, it transforms into a giant scythe that strikes down all enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601511 = "When Giles encountered his Black Ram—Isaac, he was holding this wooden staff in his hand, and later, it became a tool for him to communicate with Isaac, allowing him to summon and command it.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501521 = "It looks like a worn backpack covered in patches, in the shape of a bizarre six-eyed cat. However, May is very fond of it and never leaves it out of sight.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601531 = "The blade of this spear is red in color as if it is burning. It stood by Reinhardt's side while she faced numerous crises and survived countless life-and-death battles. Reinhardt has now fully mastered the spear.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601541 = "A crossbow found amongst ancient relics is capable of shooting out arrows fast. With her Luminatics and newly learned techniques, Vice is able to target her enemies' vital points with the crossbow fatally.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601551 = "Once two separate swords, they can be combined into a double-tipped sword when necessary. Barton wields it as if it's a swift wind sweeping all these enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601561 = "It may sound like the name of a location, but it's the black parasol that Nina carries with her. Upon using Luminatics, Nina can summon all kinds of weapons from it.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501571 = "The ribbon that Sanae carries with her all the time. It can not only channel Sanae's Lumina to attack the enemy, but also allows her to manipulate her puppet to fight.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601581 = [[
Joker's weapon.
It looks like a dagger.]],
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501621 = [[
Mona's weapon.
It looks like the type of sword popular with thieves.]],
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501601 = [[
Fox's weapon.
It looks like a katana.]],
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601591 = [[
Queen's weapon.
It looks like a boxing glove.]],
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501611 = [[
Violet's weapon.
It looks like a sharp rapier.]],
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501681 = "After Rainbow settled down on the Emerald, the ship's engineer built a high-pressure water gun for her. Although it looks very ordinary, the water pressure can be adjusted to spray water with varying intensity. However, it can explode with enormous power when used with Rainbow's Luminatics.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601661 = "A modified flare gun that is small, flexible, and easy to use. It can launch small grenades at enemies to attack them and launch markers to guide trained animals to attack.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601671 = "A specially made card deck that contains the mysteries of the \"Origin.\" Victoria gave this deck of cards to Jeno when he joined the True Order. Jeno's superb control over the cards allows him to use them to activate all sorts of magical powers.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501651 = "While operating it for the first time, Ciel mastered the use of this wrench without a teacher. After that, Ciel used this wrench to complete the assembly of two sets of dynamic mecha and even repair many key parts in emergencies... To Ciel, this wrench is not an ordinary tool but an extension of her craftsmanship.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601641 = "Carleen gained new insights about combat after that journey, and this lance was also endowed with different abilities. Even the exclusive mark on it changed! Without question, this means that Carleen has an unparalleled mastery of this lance.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501301 = "There are no words in this special law codex. In fact, it is not for reading, but for \"fighting.\" Only its owner knows how to use it.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501711 = "This rifle is equipped with a large and strong blade. It doesn't affect shooting accuracy, and comes in handy in melee combat.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601701 = "It is said to be one of Pollux's favorite pistols. It is strong, durable, and powerful. She can enhance the bullets with her Luminatics, making them land on targets with greater impact.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1401691 = "After a certain mission and at the behest of a friend, Sadie took up a weapon that perfectly suited her fighting style: a modified baseball bat. After constant, rigorous training, Sadie can finally channel her titanic strength through her trusty bat and send any foe flying; she can even send a car sky-high!",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601721 = "Lilica's very first video camera, and a loving gift from her parents. Despite being a second-hand camera, she cherishes it above any other possession; after mastering its various functions, Lilica can even enhance it with her Luminatics to shoot anywhere and anytime, even on the battlefield. This provides her allies with much-needed support in combat.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601731 = "In reality, it is just an ordinary flintlock pistol. However, under Minos' meticulous maintenance, he can infuse it with his Luminatics to make it unleash several times its original power.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501761 = "The collective name of \"Borealis\" and \"Australis.\" \"Borealis\" is a double bladed spear, while \"Australis\" is a long spear. Beretta's amazing strength allows her to easily swing these two long weapons that ordinary soldiers need both hands to use with one hand. She can also throw \"Australis\" for ranged attacks.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601751 = "Although these robots all look alike, Axelia would never mix them up. Made especially by the Illumina Federation for Axelia's use, this can accommodate lots of weapons and can help her in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601771 = "This is the microphone used by Goldie during performances. Made of precious metals, it synchronizes with her unique abilities to transmit the sound of her singing to the ears of all listeners, so that her songs may dispel the dense fog in all hearts.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601781 = "Although it looks like a simple trekking pole, it is solid enough to be used as a weapon. As for the case... it contains strange animals that attack enemies when set loose.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501801 = "It may simply be a camera for a fledgling reporter, but Brandy can use it very proficiently to take all kinds of snapshots and find her enemies' weaknesses so she can target them.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501831 = "Liqing has been using this scale to weigh herbs ever since learning the healing arts. Its precise measurement helps him parcel the correct, perfect portion every time. Liqing's knowledge of medicine improves as he becomes more proficient with using the scale.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601821 = "This dagger is allegedly crafted from the bone of one of Yuebai's ancestors. It boasts tremendous cutting and stabbing power. She has a mystical bond with it, wielding it with precision from the first moment she laid hands on it. It subsequently became her signature weapon.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601811 = "Zhong Xu obtained this ring after inheriting his family's Flame Force Arts as a symbol of the clan's acknowledgment. Whenever notions of quitting or retiring surfaces in him, cracks appear in the object. Because the ring makes his private emotions conspicuous to others, he rarely shows it to anybody.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601841 = "Keepsakes given to Jeriah by Hawk and Sacred Python, said to be the first feather and scale they each respectfully grew, an indication of their absolute trust in Jeriah. It improves their chemistry with her in battle.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501851 = "When Kya became a courier, she was already carrying this weapon at her side, and it has served her well ever since, accompanying her to safely deliver mail around the world. She continues carrying this crossbow, believing that as long as she has it, even if danger finds her during her job, she'll still make her deliveries on time.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601861 = "Born in a noble family, Tina has been extremely talented with swords since she was a child. This long sword has followed her for a long time. Only with this sword can she use the unique Lumina energy she has mastered to its limits.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601891 = "Although it's nothing like the weapons traditionally used by knights in Lumopolis, Leyn, who cares more about a weapon's practical use than its looks, doesn't mind it at all, which reflects his character more or less... Leyn can infuse Luminatics into this weapon to make it continuously rotate, accelerate, and activate a switch to make Lumina gush out to destroy his enemies.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501901 = "Usually a staff, it becomes a long whip when Matthieu infuses it with Lumina. Flames swim wildly all over it, releasing a brilliant light that warns offenders not to approach. Those who are bold enough to try will taste the pain of remorse.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501931 = "Kristen has been able to use this lance ever since she first received martial arts training and can use Lumina to enhance its might. She can also use it to control water, summoning powerful torrents capable of parting raging waves.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601911 = "The horse head seal on the locket makes it look extremely precious. It's rumored to be made out of pure gold! The exquisite mechanism inside it requires Hati and another person to open it together.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601921 = "Although Leo's sword might not look like anything special compared to those legendary weapons, in his hands, it has become a potent symbol of dominance over his people. This is likely due, at least in part, to Leo's inherent charisma.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601991 = "This sniper rifle stands out from any ordinary firearm due to its unique material and structure, which were carefully crafted by a specialized department specifically for Yingel. Even those unfamiliar with firearms can detect obvious traces of modifications made to this exceptional weapon.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502001 = "An old notebook where Anatoli records all the intelligence he's gathered over time. Although it's covered in various labels and tags, and you might catch the occasional glimpse of some of Anatoli's doodles.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602011 = "The staff Mia wielded during her time with the Lumo Knights. Initially, Mia paid little attention to it. However, as she donned her old attire and reclaimed this relic from the past, she realized its remarkable power to perfectly manifest her strength, drawing upon both her past and present abilities effortlessly.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602021 = "Schwartz possesses remarkable skill in wielding a colossal sword, renowned for its formidable weight and challenging nature for others to handle. Through his dedicated training and mastery of Luminatics, he effortlessly wields this mighty weapon. Additionally, he harnesses the power of Luminatics to craft similar blades, granting him the ability to launch devastating assaults on his foes, gain the upper hand in battle, and ultimately emerge triumphant in his endeavors.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502031 = "A thick and weighty book, left behind by her mother, Boaz, who was renowned as the most skilled diviner in Northland. This invaluable book contains Boaz's extensive research findings and a collection of her diverse experiences. In essence, it serves as a valuable resource to enhance Jakine's divination abilities, offering significant assistance in her practice.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502051 = "She wields a large, heavy scythe as effortlessly as she would a stirring spoon. With this deadly weapon in hand, her battles become as leisurely as a spot of afternoon tea. With a smile, she easily dispatches her foes under a crimson flurry of relentless attacks.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602041 = "Despite its ornate decorations, this blunt rapier is not just for display. When powered by Joshua's Luminatics, especially her conviction to protect her family, it surges with an inconceivable might.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602061 = "Behind every business prodigy is a constant stream of ideas! When Lorelei's entrepreneurial ventures face challenges, she unloads her ammo, pulls the trigger of this pistol, and listens to the resounding click of the firing pin. More often than not, new sparkles of ideas arise, making it Lorelei's go-to weapon.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602071 = "A hallmark of a true gentleman is the ability to maintain elegance and dress appropriately for any occasion. In battle, he adorns himself with both the hat and this gun, which, in reality, are merely decorative pieces and not functional weapons—he simply believes that doing so will evoke a \"battle ambiance.\"",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502081 = "Rumor has it that this sturdy steel chain was once used to bind the fearsome Giant Lizard before Bopper became a member of the Rediesel Wrench. While it might just be a tall tale, the steel chain is undeniably durable! It can easily withstand Bopper's powerful swings and strikes.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602091 = "Forged by reassembling the original Floating Machine Array, this spear resonates with the very essence of Wrath. Its innate affinity for Wrath renders it an extension of her arm and will. Once powered by her Luminatics, it can vanquish all foes in close combat and also be thrown out like a javelin to pierce through enemy formations.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502101 = "Much like its wielder's destiny, this rapier started as an ordinary weapon used in Joselyne's daily training. However, after Joselyne wielded it to defend Twilight, the rapier seemingly took on an otherworldly power. Whenever clasped by Joselyne, the blade never dulls, never breaks, forever retaining its unparalleled sharpness.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602121 = "The multifunctional mountaineering pole, crafted from materials personally gathered by Antony, stands as an indispensable tool for his expeditions. Throughout the crafting process, durability is the sole concern, thus leading to its unimpressive appearance. After countless modifications, it has now reached its seventh iteration, featuring functions such as a transmitter, lights, and basic radar.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602111 = "Once Zarya broke free from the haze of the past, she found it was no longer that frozen cage entrapping her, but the power freely flourishing in her hands. The ice crystals she condensed, shimmering with a fluorescence similar to her glowing hair, are simply reshaped snow, formed by a more determined heart.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502131 = "These multi-jointed robotic arms are an alternative type of appendage installed on No. 33's body, which is more flexible, convenient, and deadlier than the average Aurorian's arms. They can hold multiple repair tools at once to penetrate mechanical structures and undertake maintenance, and they can also be installed with claws and electric charge to penetrate enemy defenses.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1501871 = "Li Tianxian carries a long banner that is said to aid him in divination. However, its primary function is to attract all kinds of potential customers. However, this banner is not to be underestimated—in battle, Li Tianxian can use it to unleash his unique Luminatics, in conjunction with his avian accomplice, to attack his enemies from unexpected locations.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1601881 = "This pipa boasts a very wide tonal range capable of expressing a diverse array of emotions. Dantang has also discovered that the more she plays it, the greater her control over Lumina becomes, so she makes a point of carrying it wherever she goes.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602141 = "A unique ability Rebecca was born with, it protects her from potential threats and grants her the power to protect her loved ones too. The only thing is, as far as Rebecca's concerned, it's not entirely clear whether this power is a blessing or a curse...",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502151 = "Isa paid a pretty penny for her prized whip—a weapon that performs excellently on the battlefield and inflicts unbearable pain on her victims. She's extremely fond of this weapon, and has explored its vast range of possible uses to the limit, including her personal favorites—thrashing and binding. Of course, this weapon also has a use that trumps all others in terms of importance—protecting Rebecca.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602161 = "Xuan Ji's favorite clockwork parasol, which incorporates the strengths of the Ye Kingdom's schools of artisanship, is nimble and versatile like an animal and as portable and easy to dismantle as an inanimate object. It can store copper dragonflies and clockwork birds, as well as release arrows and a barrage of pelts. When wielded, it can be used to stab, thrust, swipe, and slash, used as a shield or a plow... and to hide from the rain.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602181 = "Sheol received this valuable, golden keepsake from her mother. The most important thing is that it is extremely compatible with Sheol's Lumina, allowing her to release amazing powers.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602191 = "As if it was tearing apart the red tape of life, the gilded staff transformed into a heavy claw armor that masked darkness and violence well under its elegance. The attack of the flaming claw is like a charging chariot. And this is the true Shadowlord.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502201 = "Vergil's backpack is filled with all sorts of yummy food and a set of appraisal tools. However, Vergil has combined them in a very strange way so that he can use them at any time. Vergil is probably the only person who can use them in this world.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602211 = "Bool is a nanorobot that lives on Algol and is said to have caused its master to suffer broken bones and tendons. However, Bool becomes really ferocious against anything that threatens its master's existence.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602231 = "The first scale shed by Chen'ni, preserved for its significance. As a silent testament to Longzhou's and Chen'ni's histories, it traverses millennia with her. Whenever Chen'ni uses it to manifest her true form, the scale bears invisible marks of her memories.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502241 = "Luo Song's companion, Ding, is a tiger fiendling still honing his skills. His current training focuses on physical enhancement and growth. As for engaging in smooth thinking and articulate speech like Aurorians, well, that is a goal for the future.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602251 = "Once an ordinary spear made of ash wood, but after Bethlehem modified it and infused it with Lumina, it could now unleash tremendous power in Tiare's hands. The Northlanders believe this spear possesses the power to summon thunders and call winds, thus dubbing it the \"Windcaller.\" In reality, Tiare never gave it a name.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1202261 = "Irresistibly catchy croak and has proven to be quite helpful in the Dream. While it's hard for the prince to perform miracles in real life, its warmth and kindness will always inspire us!",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602271 = "If you see a drone flash through the sky in the blink of an eye, Rachel is likely not far away. The three Eagle Hunters that accompany her on every mission are modified by her own two hands. Each is capable of executing scouting tasks around the clock, including reconnaissance, interference, tracking, and more. Their speed and performance are unmatched in the Illumina Federation's military.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502281 = "\"Conan the Enlightened\" was the very first manga that Zeta ever read, as well as the catalyst that triggered her obsession with role-playing. As a result, Zeta tends to name her strongest robot \"Conan\" as an homage to her most beloved series.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602291 = "This exquisite little console seems to be the same model as Batia's first game machine. To this day, she still thinks of that time-worn first-generation console as her first friend and mentor.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602301 = "When she gained power from the mysterious passage, Victoria's Bloody Bible unfurled suddenly and took a new form. Prophecies pour out like rapids, draining all wisdom to lead the harbinger of change to a new path.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602311 = "The seemingly empty hilt, when grasped by Wilhelm, drips blood that forms the blade. The concept of the sword is \"Dominion,\" its true name \"Crimson Tide.\" Fierce red light pierces clouds and sky, scattering everything in the path like falling petals.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502321 = "Perhaps sanctified from the Rare Blood by the Lord of Truth, the Nails of Piety became a cross-shaped blood sword - the Sword of Sacred Blood. It is both the punishment and salvation of Nails. In the name of saints, Nails stabs himself with it, releasing Sacred Blood to purify the world.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602331 = "A staff that emits a strong glow. Even when idle, it continues to flicker with a dazzling brilliance. Bathed in this light, not only the wielder, but also those around them will feel their hearts becoming brighter.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602341 = "The arrows it shoots shine like stars in the darkness, hence its name. No one would want to be targeted by such a bow in the dark.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1502351 = "It is said that this sword has a will of its own and chooses its wielder. Even the most skilled cannot control it without a noble soul.",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602371 = [[
An immaculate conch that reflects lights. Only the Mirage Clan knows how to play. It is said to be a joint of the Mirage Bone. When Maya picked it up, she clearly saw the essence of the world, and her heart began beating in harmony with her ancestors.
The world may be a fantasy, but the glorious lights between those fleeting moments are worthy of a beautiful eulogy.]],
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602381 = "An emblem that Achilles gifted to Anthony. It is filled with immense power. He sincerely wished it would help the Longinus clan fight against destiny. However, each generation of the Longinus clan couldn't bear to use the emblem, letting it remain just a symbol of their noble oath. Even Mithra would only use it to enhance her blade.",
  str_pet_equip_name_1602411 = "Flames Ablaze",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1602411 = [[
The innate Lumina; the artificial kinetic heart given by the Committee; the energy-storing emblem bestowed by Victoria; the life-reversing power gifted by the Wraith, Ursura... and Pepita's unyielding heart that still beats strong even outside her chest.
Together, they create this miracle as Pepita ignites the power of her own heart.]],
  str_pet_equip_name_1702361 = "Ludweiss's Moonlight",
  str_pet_equip_intro_1702361 = "A colossal blade, forged specifically for Claymore. The blade is scarred from countless battles yet this brutal-looking weapon has never turned its edge to an Aurorian. It was for this reason that Achilles named it after his gentle friend—\nA testament to the blade's true purpose: protection.",
  str_pet_equip_string = "Equipment",
